{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>黃又南昨日（11月2日）迎來43歲生日，回顧過去一年幕前幕後多項突破，包括作品上映、考獲電車車長牌照及落場參與 …</p><p></p>\n<p>黃又南昨日（11月2日）迎來43歲生日，回顧過去一年幕前幕後多項突破，包括作品上映、考獲電車車長牌照及落場參與賽車。事業迎來新進展之際，單身近5年之後，他在生日帖末段公開另一個令人意外的願望。</p>\n<h2>黃又南生日帖回顧一年突破</h2>\n<p>黃又南在社交平台發表長文，逐一細數過去一年的經歷，除了分享影視工作獲得正面迴響，亦提到自己成功取得電車車長牌照，並以賽車手身分參加多場賽事。從幕前演出走到駕駛席及賽道，他形容當中有勝有負，希望趁仍有體力時，多做真正喜歡的事情。</p>\n<h2>黃又南親述賽車承諾安全為先</h2>\n<p>面對家人及公司對賽車安全的關注，黃又南在帖文中主動報平安，表示已答應大家參賽時會格外小心，亦以「平安大吉」安撫身邊人。他從多次跨界嘗試中得到「事在人為」的體會，並鼓勵大家不要輕易被生活困境擊倒，字裏行間流露出繼續挑戰新事物的決心。</p>\n<h2>《再見UFO》上映為事業添喜訊</h2>\n<p>演藝工作方面，拍攝多年的電影《再見UFO》終於順利上映兼獲得多個獎項，黃又南雖然未有得獎，但獲提名肯定已感到滿足。他參演的《我們不是什麼》及《存酒人》亦得到正面迴響。至於感情生活，他透露自己已單身近5年，43歲生日除了期望挑戰更多角色，亦首次明言會「認真考慮拍拍拖」。</p>\n<h2>網民聚焦單身五年生日願望</h2>\n<p>黃又南公開一年成績與人生感悟後，獲得不少粉絲送上生日祝福，其電車車長牌照、賽車手經歷及感情願望亦成為焦點。相比幕前作品帶來的肯定，他在單身近5年後主動表示考慮戀愛，令這篇原本以事業回顧為主的帖文突然出現反差，粉絲亦關注他來年會否迎來感情新進展。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369488959939159_9145344956ae99ca9df46f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"wongyounam_1793599629_4021327049240328495_366892595.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369488959939159_9145344956ae99ca9df46f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@wongyounam）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369489080281089_21446700906ae99cab079eb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"wongyounam_1793599629_4021327012733083958_366892595.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369489080281089_21446700906ae99cab079eb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@wongyounam）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369489336226298_14145516646ae99cadbad41.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"wongyounam_1793599629_4021327022698788791_366892595.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369489336226298_14145516646ae99cadbad41.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/zx7rxneptns5l7evqopgmns1kvlavclywoie8mkinva_1645029500690c17548e3bb-1024x1024.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃又南 shine 又南早前完成人生第一場賽車。（圖片來源：IG@wongyounam）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/zx7rxneptns5l7evqopgmns1kvlavclywoie8mkinva_1645029500690c17548e3bb-1024x1024.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>又南早前完成人生第一場賽車。（圖片來源：IG@wongyounam）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/17794421826811730_1880275866a102206d84e3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"703414746_17964552255118109_2631568202876082279_n.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/17794421826811730_1880275866a102206d84e3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176537840077420099_973667596693989613d4f6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃又南 駕駛牌照 早前獲得巴士牌（圖片來源：IG@wongyounam）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176537840077420099_973667596693989613d4f6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>早前獲得巴士牌（圖片來源：IG@wongyounam）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176537840286889804_2406628456939896325e64.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃又南 駕駛牌照 又有的士排（圖片來源：IG@wongyounam）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176537840286889804_2406628456939896325e64.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>又有的士排（圖片來源：IG@wongyounam）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%97%9d%e4%ba%ba%e6%88%80%e6%83%85/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">藝人戀情</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%9b%bb%e8%bb%8a%e8%bb%8a%e9%95%b7/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">電車車長</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%bb%83%e5%8f%88%e5%8d%97/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">黃又南</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3535301\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 3 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:03:01.588078+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1160,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:34:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:19:05.079884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:59:10.006629+00:00","content_hash":"c3553e329dd7c62491642552899e623d87ee13a9df4f977ba6f872dbd9d8b798","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}